&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-1j4zddb&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who we are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab ® is a global leader in IoT and connected transportation and certified “Great Place to Work™.” We are a company of diverse and talented individuals who work together to help businesses grow and succeed, and increase the safety and sustainability of our communities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Geotab is advancing security, connecting commercial vehicles to the internet and providing web-based analytics to help customers better manage their fleets. Geotab’s open platform and Geotab Marketplace ®, offering hundreds of third-party solution options, allows both small and large businesses to automate operations by integrating vehicle data with their other data assets. Processing billions of data points a day, Geotab leverages data analytics and machine learning to improve productivity, optimize fleets through the reduction of fuel consumption, enhance driver safety and achieve strong compliance to regulatory changes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;Our team is growing and we’re looking for people who follow their passion, think differently and want to make an impact. Ours is a fast paced, ever changing environment. Geotabbers accept that challenge and are willing to take on new tasks and activities - ones that may not always be described in the initial job description. Join us for a fulfilling career with opportunities to innovate, great benefits, and our fun and inclusive work culture. Reach your full potential with Geotab. To see what it’s like to be a Geotabber, check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.geotab.com/blog/&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and follow us @InsideGeotab on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-inherit MuiLink-root MuiLink-underlineHover css-sbvzk&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidegeotab/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;Who you are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;We are always looking for amazing talent who can contribute to our growth and deliver results! Geotab is seeking an Enterprise Portfolio Project Manager who will manage key cross-functional technical projects and initiatives that vary in scope and complexity with impact on several business areas across the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;. If you love technology, and are keen to join an industry leader — we would love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,0&quot;&gt;As an Enterprise Portfolio Project Manager your key area of responsibility will be ensuring projects produce the required deliverables of quality, within specified time constraints and cost and to achieve the potential benefits defined in the business case&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,2&quot;&gt;. You will need to work closely with all Geotab teams and/or external partners&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,3&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,4&quot;&gt;. To be successful in this role you will be self-motivated and decisive with the ability to adapt to change and competing demands, possessing excellent leadership, communication, and interpersonal skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,5&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,6&quot;&gt;. In addition, the successful candidate will have technical competence using software programs (including Google Suite for business) and the ability to work creatively and analytically in a problem-solving environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0,0,7&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-46&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Responsible for overall project execution success, serving as the main point of contact for clients, senior management, and project stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-47&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Oversee all aspects of the implementation and progression of assigned projects, from original concept through project closure activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-48&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Provide leadership for the project team by building and motivating them to meet project goals and adhere to their responsibilities and project milestones&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-49&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Collaborate effectively with stakeholders to define comprehensive project scope and clear, measurable objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-50&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Contribute to defining the resources required to support the project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-51&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop detailed work plans, defining key project tasks and deliverables, and manage the integration of resources and knowledge across projects and tasks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-52&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,0&quot;&gt;Proactively identify, manage, and mitigate project issues, risks, and changes to ensure project success and minimize impact on scope, schedule, and budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,6,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-53&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Communicate expectations to project team members and stakeholders in a timely manner&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,7,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-54&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,8,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,8,0,0&quot;&gt;Partner with various business units, acting as the liaison between the different areas of the business, the customer/partner and technical teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,8,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,8,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-55&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,9,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,9,0,0&quot;&gt;Provide clear and timely status reporting regarding project milestones, deliverables, dependencies, risks and issues to ensure stakeholders are informed and aligned on project progress, risks, and critical decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,9,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,9,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-56&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,10,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,10,0,0&quot;&gt;Maintain up-to-date project document repository, ensuring all project artifacts are accessible and current&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,10,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,10,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-57&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,11,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,11,0,0&quot;&gt;Develop and deliver progress reports to management and other stakeholders including issue/action item logs, project status, and risks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,11,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,11,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-58&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,12,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,12,0,0&quot;&gt;Conduct &lt;span class=&quot;citation-77 citation-end-77&quot;&gt;post-project reviews and make recommendations for continuous excellence in project execution and delivery&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,12,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,12,0,2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-76 citation-end-76&quot;&gt;.&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-59&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,13,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;citation-75 citation-end-75&quot;&gt;Participate in establishing best practices, templates, policies, tools and partnerships to ex&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot; data-turn-source-index=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;pand and mature these capabilities for the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,13,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,13,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-60&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,14,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,14,0,0&quot;&gt;Ensure adherence to corporate standards and practices and serve as a key contact in the escalation process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,14,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,14,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-61&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,15,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,15,0,0&quot;&gt;Support Geotab global strategic initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,15,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,15,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(37, 71, 123);&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring to the role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;MuiGrid-root css-17v2lcf&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-62&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,0&quot;&gt;3 - 5 years of required previous experience in Project Management or relevant working experience which demonstrates experience driving projects to completion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-63&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Post-Secondary Diploma/Degree with a specialization in Business, Engineering or a related Technical field (or equivalent combination of education and/or work experience)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-64&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience working in a technical or engineering organization, knowledge of the high-technology industry, and/or experience in compliance, privacy, or security risk management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-65&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong technical competence with JIRA (highly preferred), Agile approaches (SCRUM, XP, Kanban), and Google Suite for business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-66&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Excellent communication, leadership, diplomatic, and motivational skills with the ability to engage with all levels of the organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_2a94393d6e023169-67&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(102, 120, 140);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Professional certifications such as PMP, Agile/Scrum (PMI-ACP, CSM/PSM), or Technical Certifications (CISSP, CISA, Cloud) are highly valued&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0,1&quot;&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;superscript&quot;&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;10,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
